      <unit id="backup.title">
        <notes><note category="description">Title of the backup page and its entry in the browser tab.</note></notes>
        <segment><source>Backup</source></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="backup.lede">
        <segment><source>A backup is one encrypted file with the store, the keys of the vault and the TLS files, so the installation can be restored on a new host with that file and its passphrase or key file. Backups are always encrypted.</source></segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="backup.now">
